WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:18.030
Lady Rishe, are you awake?

00:18.690 --> 00:20.450
I'm Prince Arnold's aide, Oliver.

00:20.680 --> 00:23.290
Y-Yes! Just a moment, please!

00:27.430 --> 00:29.200
Thank you for waiting.

00:29.200 --> 00:30.670
My apologies.

00:30.880 --> 00:34.530
This is the only time I could manage 
to get away from the prince's office.

00:35.590 --> 00:37.760
Then, you haven't managed any rest?

00:38.180 --> 00:40.300
I'm better off than others are.

00:40.300 --> 00:43.580
Prince Arnold hasn't managed even a nap.

00:44.090 --> 00:47.770
He's been hard-pressed to complete the work 
that accumulated while he was away in Hermity.

00:48.340 --> 00:50.400
I feel I should apologize.

00:50.650 --> 00:51.430
Not at all.

00:51.880 --> 00:54.400
The prince said he had no intention to marry,

00:54.770 --> 00:57.500
but through these events,
he's found a lady to be his wife.

01:02.180 --> 01:04.870
Please look as much as you'd like.

01:05.100 --> 01:06.190
Pardon?

01:06.190 --> 01:08.540
You were examining me, weren't you?

01:09.760 --> 01:11.760
My apologies! That was terribly rude of me.

01:12.500 --> 01:16.130
Your insight is just as keen 
as the prince said it is.

01:16.130 --> 01:20.640
Master Oliver, your worry for 
His Highness truly is heartfelt.

01:20.910 --> 01:23.260
Have you been with him long?

01:23.260 --> 01:24.670
It's been ten years.

01:25.160 --> 01:27.600
If you've served him for that long,

01:27.980 --> 01:32.480
then would you know why he 
has decided to marry me?

01:32.750 --> 01:36.940
Well, to be honest, I'm 
surprised by it as well.

01:37.680 --> 01:41.240
However, I've never seen the prince so happy.

01:41.620 --> 01:45.330
When he's with you, Lady Rishe, 
his smile is so honest and open.

01:45.330 --> 01:48.330
I feel I'm being treated as some sort of toy.

01:49.770 --> 01:51.790
<i>He isn't denying it.</i>

01:52.410 --> 01:54.640
I didn't mean to get 
absorbed in conversation.

01:54.640 --> 01:59.300
His Highness asked me to bring you a list of 
the honored guests for the wedding ceremony.

01:59.770 --> 02:01.680
Thank you.

02:01.680 --> 02:04.860
<i>Princess Harriet of Siguel.</i>

02:04.860 --> 02:08.650
<i>Duke Jonal will be in attendance 
to represent the Kingdom of Domana.</i>

02:08.650 --> 02:11.590
<i>And Prince Kyle of Coyolles...</i>

02:12.070 --> 02:15.580
And this is a list of attendees 
for the party tomorrow evening.

02:17.990 --> 02:19.420
The party?

04:05.090 --> 04:07.570
Um, Miss Diana, where do these go?

04:07.570 --> 04:11.000
Go and line them up the way I 
showed you yesterday please.

04:11.000 --> 04:11.570
But...

04:11.570 --> 04:13.270
I'm in the middle of something right now.

04:18.840 --> 04:20.070
It's Rishe.

04:20.070 --> 04:23.540
Your Highness, may I have 
a moment of your time?

04:23.540 --> 04:24.360
Yes.

04:29.250 --> 04:32.790
Prince Arnold, I've come 
to beg something of you.

04:32.790 --> 04:35.790
You did tell me to think 
of something, didn't you?

04:36.210 --> 04:38.120
Think of something you want.

04:39.000 --> 04:41.870
My agreement not to lay a finger on you.

04:41.870 --> 04:44.220
This time, I truly did break it.

04:44.720 --> 04:48.880
Would it be possible to leave the 
selection of my maids to me?

04:48.880 --> 04:51.590
You can do as you like with that, but...

04:56.460 --> 04:58.770
It seems Oliver didn't tell you.

04:59.900 --> 05:01.310
This party tonight...

05:01.310 --> 05:05.020
It's meant to say, "The crown prince is 
looking for someone to marry from the empire."

05:05.020 --> 05:08.740
It's a pointless pretense
held to keep up appearances.

05:08.740 --> 05:10.040
Your Highness,

05:10.040 --> 05:14.800
in this country, I am the crown 
princess only as a hostage.

05:15.730 --> 05:18.930
However, I find no dishonor in that.

05:20.200 --> 05:21.210
Please,

05:21.910 --> 05:24.530
feel free to formally reveal 
your fiancée at the party.

05:29.150 --> 05:30.710
I suppose I have no choice.

05:30.710 --> 05:33.470
Especially as I've received 
your permission to touch you.

05:33.470 --> 05:36.330
Well, we are both wearing gloves after all.

05:55.890 --> 06:00.060
This seems to be a much grander 
event than I'd anticipated.

06:00.060 --> 06:02.250
This is still on the smaller side.

06:02.250 --> 06:04.300
The standards of a large 
country are different.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.420
Prince Arnold!

06:06.420 --> 06:09.780
I was honored to receive an 
invitation to attend this evening!

06:09.780 --> 06:11.930
Thank you for coming.

06:12.190 --> 06:16.680
Your Highness, please tell my 
daughter stories of your travels.

06:16.680 --> 06:20.690
Unfortunately, there aren't any points 
worth speaking of on their own,

06:21.220 --> 06:24.500
but I did find good fortune on my trip.

06:26.020 --> 06:29.070
As you can see, I've found 
someone to be my wife.

06:30.030 --> 06:31.280
Did he say wife?

06:31.280 --> 06:33.080
His Highness is smiling!

06:33.080 --> 06:36.370
But he's never so much as
 glanced in our direction!

06:36.370 --> 06:39.620
Then, this beautiful lady is...

06:40.660 --> 06:44.330
<i>Curiosity, jealousy, ulterior motives...</i>

06:44.330 --> 06:48.040
<i>Compared with having my engagement 
broken in front of everyone,</i>

06:48.040 --> 06:50.170
<i>this feels like nothing at all.</i>

06:52.650 --> 06:54.480
I am pleased to meet all of you.

06:55.010 --> 06:57.810
My name is Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.

07:05.900 --> 07:09.320
As my future wife has only just arrived from 
another country, she has no one to rely on here.

07:09.320 --> 07:11.070
I would like for you to help her.

07:11.070 --> 07:13.160
Of course we will!

07:19.850 --> 07:24.620
"Future wife"? There's no need to 
provoke the other ladies that way.

07:24.620 --> 07:26.930
It's better to make it 
apparent now, while we can.

07:27.450 --> 07:28.300
Make what apparent?

07:29.360 --> 07:33.140
The fact that I will protect 
you, no matter what happens.

07:33.830 --> 07:35.140
<i>Protect?</i>

07:35.380 --> 07:37.080
<i>Did he just say "protect"?</i>

07:37.080 --> 07:38.740
<i>Arnold Hein?</i>

07:39.200 --> 07:42.280
<i>The man who killed me?</i>

07:43.600 --> 07:46.890
Your Highness is probably the 
one who is most dangerous to me.

07:46.890 --> 07:48.280
In what sense?

07:49.830 --> 07:52.730
Well, I don't think I could 
match you in swordplay.

07:53.270 --> 07:56.610
It might be worthwhile for me to 
try sparring with you one day.

07:56.610 --> 07:59.000
I would like that very much!

07:59.000 --> 08:02.040
And I know it's asking a lot, but I'd 
love to receive training from you!

08:04.530 --> 08:07.790
You always reply in ways 
that exceed my expectations.

08:08.730 --> 08:13.020
<i>I may learn the attack method behind 
that fearsome sword technique.</i>

08:15.400 --> 08:16.800
No need to force yourself to dance.

08:17.580 --> 08:21.180
Oh, but as I'm here anyway, 
I would like to enjoy myself.

08:40.280 --> 08:41.750
<i>This closeness...</i>

08:41.970 --> 08:44.210
<i>It takes me back to that moment.</i>

08:53.510 --> 08:55.880
<i>Perhaps I'll try playing 
a little trick on him.</i>

08:56.710 --> 09:00.260
<i>If I take the lead, what will he do?</i>

09:03.910 --> 09:05.410
<i>Then, what about this?</i>

09:11.070 --> 09:14.320
<i>He looks like he'd like to say, "No 
matter what you do, it's no use."</i>

09:22.580 --> 09:26.670
<i>He's so close, but he hasn't 
crossed over into my space at all.</i>

09:31.670 --> 09:32.420
<i>Wait...</i>

09:32.980 --> 09:35.010
<i>Now that I think about it, he's been...</i>

09:38.340 --> 09:40.930
<i>No. Back then, too, the whole time, he was...</i>

09:55.820 --> 09:56.900
<i>I'm going to fall!</i>

10:05.310 --> 10:07.290
That was splendid!

10:07.290 --> 10:09.950
The two of you were perfectly 
in step with each other!

10:09.950 --> 10:12.790
It was as though I was 
watching a sword dance!

10:23.910 --> 10:25.080
Lady Rishe?

10:25.920 --> 10:29.270
Your dance earlier was quite lovely.

10:29.270 --> 10:31.190
Thank you.

10:31.190 --> 10:33.980
If you'd like, please accept this wine.

10:37.250 --> 10:38.710
Thank you, I will.

10:43.250 --> 10:46.230
<i>That's the aroma of crushed red peppers.</i>

10:46.230 --> 10:48.290
<i>To think they'd play pranks with food.</i>

10:48.610 --> 10:51.780
This wine has an unusually striking aroma.

10:51.780 --> 10:53.540
It's quite intriguing.

10:53.540 --> 10:57.010
Are you displeased with 
the wine I've brought you?

11:02.780 --> 11:06.680
As I thought, it has a 
very stimulating flavor.

11:07.000 --> 11:11.110
It makes me very happy to have 
been welcomed in such a way.

11:12.640 --> 11:13.760
Let's go.

11:22.290 --> 11:23.310
That's spicy.

11:23.920 --> 11:24.730
Spicy?

11:25.240 --> 11:26.310
Your Highness.

11:27.240 --> 11:30.000
This wine has peppers in 
it. It's a special blend.

11:31.360 --> 11:33.250
You should just throw that away.

11:33.440 --> 11:38.810
No. This wine has lost its chance 
to be enjoyed for its flavor.

11:38.810 --> 11:41.210
The least I can do for it is to drink it all.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.530
What? Wait!

11:46.590 --> 11:47.680
Spicy indeed.

11:47.680 --> 11:49.350
I did say so, didn't I?

11:49.910 --> 11:51.850
Has this fulfilled your duty to this wine?

11:53.570 --> 11:54.780
Yes.

11:55.290 --> 11:57.230
Thank you.

11:58.240 --> 12:00.720
What were you thinking 
about during our dance?

12:00.720 --> 12:01.310
What?

12:01.720 --> 12:05.490
You were thinking of someone
 other than me, weren't you?

12:12.460 --> 12:16.960
<i>I can't tell him it was his future self.</i>

12:17.790 --> 12:20.380
I was worried for your health, Your Highness.

12:23.250 --> 12:24.590
This spot...

12:24.860 --> 12:26.790
You've been wounded there, haven't you?

12:29.770 --> 12:34.530
<i>The movement of his left shoulder is 
slightly clumsier than that of his right.</i>

12:35.730 --> 12:37.070
<i>It was back then, too.</i>

12:45.520 --> 12:46.910
It's an old wound.

12:46.910 --> 12:48.880
It runs all the way along 
the top of my shoulder.

12:48.880 --> 12:51.320
There's a spot where it 
slightly constricts my skin.

12:53.470 --> 12:55.250
How horrible.

12:55.660 --> 12:57.880
<i>It's a very old scar.</i>

12:58.230 --> 13:02.270
<i>He was struck with a blade over 
and over... with killing intent.</i>

13:03.880 --> 13:06.870
Only a few people know about this scar.

13:06.870 --> 13:09.300
And no one has ever guessed at its existence.

13:09.300 --> 13:11.310
Why do you have a scar like this?

13:15.060 --> 13:16.770
The night wind has grown colder.

13:39.790 --> 13:42.400
Do you think the lady's 
maids will be chosen soon?

13:42.400 --> 13:42.990
Yes.

13:43.420 --> 13:46.970
But with the way things are, 
we probably won't be chosen.

13:50.910 --> 13:52.430
Haven't you finished yet?

13:52.820 --> 13:54.640
I-I'm sorry, Miss Diana!

13:54.640 --> 13:55.680
I'm sorry.

13:55.680 --> 13:59.690
And those sheets this morning
 weren't folded the way I taught you.

13:59.690 --> 14:03.960
With skills like that, you'll never be 
chosen as the crown princess's maids.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.120
I'll help you.

14:07.540 --> 14:09.240
You again?

14:09.240 --> 14:11.400
I don't know which group you belong to,

14:11.400 --> 14:13.490
but I'm amazed that you have 
the time to help others.

14:14.020 --> 14:16.350
And all of you, finish that up quickly.

14:18.070 --> 14:21.690
It seems that the tablecloths 
for the villa will arrive today.

14:21.690 --> 14:24.920
If we help with that, I'm certain 
we'll be valued more highly.

14:25.260 --> 14:27.010
Let's go. Maya? Laura?

14:27.010 --> 14:27.920
Yes.

14:30.300 --> 14:34.430
I'm sorry. We're just so 
bad at remembering things.

14:34.800 --> 14:37.970
You haven't been at the 
palace very long, have you?

14:38.470 --> 14:40.860
No one gets everything 
right in the beginning.

14:41.730 --> 14:45.840
<i>And it isn't that Elsie and the 
others are unused to doing laundry.</i>

14:45.840 --> 14:49.740
<i>They're completing their work. It's 
just taking longer, that's all.</i>

14:49.740 --> 14:52.170
<i>In that, Diana is right.</i>

14:52.170 --> 14:54.620
<i>But the cause of it is very clear.</i>

14:54.950 --> 14:58.750
Have you heard anything about Miss 
Diana's life from before she came here?

14:59.080 --> 15:03.050
I think I heard that she's from a 
wealthy family that has several shops.

15:03.050 --> 15:05.070
I've heard that, too.

15:05.070 --> 15:09.550
But they lost it all because 
they went into debt.

15:09.550 --> 15:10.620
I see.

15:18.550 --> 15:20.390
It's sparklingly clean.

15:20.390 --> 15:21.830
When did that happen?

15:21.830 --> 15:23.820
I wonder who did the cleaning here.

15:24.400 --> 15:28.080
And that girl who always turns 
up uninvited isn't here, is she?

15:28.080 --> 15:29.860
An upstart newcomer like her?

15:29.860 --> 15:31.570
Of course she wouldn't be here.

15:31.570 --> 15:36.120
Indeed. To serve the crown princess, 
manners are absolutely essential.

15:36.600 --> 15:38.050
My heart's pounding. Is yours?

15:38.050 --> 15:38.870
Yes.

15:38.870 --> 15:41.560
What do you think the crown princess is like?

15:43.840 --> 15:45.660
Lady Rishe is here.

16:11.940 --> 16:14.610
I am Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.

16:17.680 --> 16:19.060
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

16:19.060 --> 16:21.560
<i>I wanted to learn the truth 
about your situations,</i>

16:21.560 --> 16:24.700
<i>and I thought that speaking to you as a 
fellow maid was the best way to do it.</i>

16:25.380 --> 16:28.540
Now, I will read off some names.

16:29.130 --> 16:30.670
Miss Marguerite.

16:30.960 --> 16:31.980
Miss Elsie.

16:32.670 --> 16:33.670
Miss Nichole.

16:34.120 --> 16:35.180
Miss Rosa.

16:35.180 --> 16:36.210
Miss Hilde.

16:36.640 --> 16:37.750
Miss Amelia.

16:38.330 --> 16:41.810
These people will be my maids.

16:41.810 --> 16:42.530
What?

16:42.530 --> 16:44.560
I look forward to getting to know you better.

16:44.560 --> 16:47.170
Now, everyone whose names 
have been called, come to—

16:47.170 --> 16:48.980
But why, Lady Rishe?

16:48.980 --> 16:51.000
Everyone you've chosen is new!

16:51.000 --> 16:53.280
We have more experience as maids!

16:53.280 --> 16:53.990
Disrespectful.

16:53.990 --> 16:55.080
It's all right.

16:56.020 --> 16:58.400
Yes, what I am saying is disrespectful!

16:58.400 --> 17:01.790
But please look at our 
abilities as maids!

17:02.000 --> 17:03.370
Miss Diana.

17:03.370 --> 17:04.160
Yes?

17:04.570 --> 17:07.670
As of today, you will no longer 
hold the position of maid.

17:07.920 --> 17:08.760
What?

17:09.880 --> 17:11.020
But that's...

17:14.400 --> 17:18.160
Say, Diana? When you 
first came to the palace,

17:18.160 --> 17:20.680
can you remember what you 
had the most trouble with?

17:21.280 --> 17:24.450
Were you able to complete your work the 
way you do now right from the start?

17:25.360 --> 17:27.690
No. In the beginning...

17:28.130 --> 17:31.020
it was difficult for me to 
understand how things were done.

17:31.830 --> 17:34.690
I couldn't remember after 
being told only once.

17:35.090 --> 17:37.890
But everyone who had been 
there longer was so busy.

17:37.890 --> 17:41.370
They'd say, "I don't have time to 
teach you, so watch and remember."

17:42.220 --> 17:45.600
Even so, I've grown into a 
very competent maid!

17:45.600 --> 17:47.210
I'm not like those girls!

17:47.430 --> 17:52.300
You're right. There is one way in which 
you are very different from those girls.

17:52.580 --> 17:53.550
What?

17:53.750 --> 17:56.670
You can read and write.

17:58.610 --> 18:02.590
You were born into a merchant's family 
and received a good education,

18:02.590 --> 18:06.940
but there are very few ordinary people 
who have had the same sort of education.

18:06.940 --> 18:11.690
You could write down what those with more 
experience told you and read it again later.

18:12.320 --> 18:14.240
But what if you hadn't been able do that?

18:16.240 --> 18:19.780
Go and line them up the way I 
showed you yesterday please.

18:19.780 --> 18:20.650
But...

18:21.120 --> 18:25.370
And those sheets this morning
 weren't folded the way I taught you.

18:27.990 --> 18:32.650
When my family went bankrupt, we lost 
everything. There was no one to protect me.

18:33.650 --> 18:36.630
Even so, I made myself into a lady's maid.

18:36.630 --> 18:39.650
I kept wondering, why 
couldn't all of you do it?

18:40.910 --> 18:44.260
But it's because I didn't teach you properly.

18:47.040 --> 18:48.300
I'm sorry.

18:49.020 --> 18:51.160
I was the one in the wrong.

18:52.910 --> 18:55.510
I'm really so very sorry.

18:56.090 --> 18:59.240
Lady Rishe, Miss Diana is very skilled, 
and she always works her hardest!

18:59.240 --> 19:01.450
Please don't make her quit.

19:02.330 --> 19:06.910
Thank you, but it only makes 
sense that I wasn't chosen.

19:07.150 --> 19:08.280
Miss Diana...

19:14.000 --> 19:16.630
There's something I'd like to ask of you.

19:17.280 --> 19:22.590
I'd like to make this villa into 
a training ground for new maids.

19:22.960 --> 19:27.100
While they're learning household skills, 
I'd also like them to learn their letters.

19:27.760 --> 19:30.010
If they learn to read and 
write along with their work,

19:30.010 --> 19:32.650
wherever they go, whatever their situation, 
it will be an asset to them.

19:33.320 --> 19:38.070
Even if they find they must begin a whole 
new life, it's sure to prove useful.

19:38.570 --> 19:43.320
Diana, I'd like for you to help me 
create their teaching materials.

19:43.880 --> 19:44.980
Me?

19:46.250 --> 19:49.420
Even though I said all of 
those disrespectful things?

19:50.490 --> 19:52.370
Why, whatever could you be speaking of?

19:52.800 --> 19:54.630
Will you help me?

19:55.630 --> 19:57.690
Yes, it would be my pleasure.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.550
I see.

20:01.830 --> 20:03.520
Is it as you predicted?

20:03.520 --> 20:04.500
Of course not.

20:05.040 --> 20:08.120
Though I did think she'd 
create some sort of havoc.

20:08.120 --> 20:12.190
Showing your amusement too openly is 
disrespectful toward your future wife.

20:12.430 --> 20:15.760
Though, I may end up 
enjoying myself as well...

20:15.760 --> 20:19.660
wondering what sorts of things she 
will accomplish in this country.

20:19.660 --> 20:20.480
Oliver.

20:21.540 --> 20:26.300
I didn't bring Rishe here to be my wife to 
benefit the imperial family or the nation.

20:27.290 --> 20:30.830
As for the first words they'll learn, what 
do you think about cleaning implements?

20:31.320 --> 20:33.110
Since they're used every day,

20:33.110 --> 20:36.580
I thought everyone might be able to 
see how useful it is to memorize them.

20:36.580 --> 20:38.960
Yes, I think that's a very good idea.

20:38.960 --> 20:40.300
Thank you.

20:41.050 --> 20:42.420
Lady Rishe...

20:42.420 --> 20:47.510
Thinking of the best ways to 
teach everyone is so much fun!

20:47.710 --> 20:49.350
I'm glad to hear that.

20:51.030 --> 20:52.270
Excuse me.

20:52.490 --> 20:54.770
Lady Rishe, you must get ready soon.

20:54.770 --> 20:55.690
Yes.

20:56.120 --> 20:58.200
Then, I'll take my leave here.

20:58.200 --> 20:59.260
I'm counting on you.

20:59.980 --> 21:04.560
Oh, Miss Diana? After dinner, 
will you help me study some more?

21:04.560 --> 21:05.490
Of course.

21:05.780 --> 21:07.290
Thank you.

21:10.460 --> 21:11.740
What a lovely dress.

21:12.080 --> 21:14.190
It's the most valuable one I have.

21:14.860 --> 21:17.730
Will you help me put up my 
hair in a style to match?

21:17.730 --> 21:18.450
Yes, my lady.

21:20.350 --> 21:24.240
Um, I've heard that your guest is a merchant.

21:24.240 --> 21:27.930
Is your most valuable dress really necessary?

21:27.930 --> 21:32.500
Well, it's one potential ingredient, you see?

21:32.500 --> 21:33.930
Ingredient?

21:33.930 --> 21:39.940
<i>After all, these are the people who drilled 
what it is to be a merchant into me.</i>

21:40.240 --> 21:45.190
<i>If I can gain them as allies, then my choices
 moving forward increase dramatically.</i>

21:45.820 --> 21:49.160
<i>The Aria Trading Company has 
only just been established.</i>

21:49.160 --> 21:52.000
<i>A business negotiation with the 
imperial family of Galkhein...</i>

21:52.000 --> 21:54.950
<i>that's something they should want 
to be successful, no matter what.</i>

21:59.540 --> 22:03.960
<i>Would dressing more gaudily make me seem 
more like a mark who loves to spend money?</i>

22:04.180 --> 22:06.150
I think it's a shame.

22:06.150 --> 22:09.530
Putting your hair in a bun with some 
trailing tendrils would give you a refined air.

22:09.530 --> 22:11.590
I feel it would match this dress better.

22:11.590 --> 22:13.400
Thank you, Elsie.

22:13.400 --> 22:16.070
But this outfit is for my battle today.

22:16.070 --> 22:17.480
Battle?

22:18.430 --> 22:19.980
Your guest has arrived.

22:24.530 --> 22:28.090
Allow me to congratulate you 
on your upcoming nuptials.

22:30.670 --> 22:34.580
I am Kaine Tully, from 
the Aria Trading Company.
